cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use or refer to this research portfolio, please cite it."

title: "Onto_PPS: Pediatric Patient Safety Ontology Research Portfolio"

abstract: >
  Research portfolio documenting doctoral research on the development and
  evaluation of Onto_PPS, an ontology for pediatric patient safety. The
  repository presents a high-level overview of the research methodology,
  workflow, evaluation framework, scientific contributions, and associated
  scholarly outputs. The ontology artifact and full doctoral thesis are not
  publicly distributed in this repository.

